Instructions
F1 Hacks UI Designer
This skill provides guidelines and exact specifications for designing user interfaces, Tailwind CSS configurations, and frontend components for F1 Hacks project interfaces.
Brand Assets & Logo Integration
Official Logo Specifications
The logo features a bold, high-contrast street-art / racing hybrid style with distinct outlines and dynamic lines [cite: 1].

Logo Visual: A prominent "F1 HACKS" text mark with racing track flourishes and curved accent lines [cite: 1].
Default Logo Path/URL: /assets/f1-hacks-logo.png (or public relative path f1-hacks-logo.png)
Usage Guidelines:

Always render the logo on a high-contrast background (either off-white or dark navy/black).
Use thick, crisp rounded borders or cards when embedding the logo into header components or hero sections to align with its bold outline style [cite: 1].




