Component Guidelines


Headers & Navigation:

Place the logo prominently in the top-left navigation bar [cite: 1].
Provide high contrast between navigation links and the background [cite: 1].



Buttons & Interactive Elements:

Primary buttons: bg-f1-red text-white hover:bg-red-600 font-bold px-6 py-2 rounded-xl border-2 border-f1-dark shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_#0F111A] [cite: 1].
Secondary buttons: bg-f1-cyan text-f1-dark hover:bg-cyan-400 font-bold px-6 py-2 rounded-xl border-2 border-f1-dark [cite: 1].



